WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.000
In a project, go down to Milestones

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.500
Tap Add Milestone

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.400
Name it…

4
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:22.700
…and give it a date

5
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.200
Add

6
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:30.000
It joins the project's milestones

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.500
…in date order

8
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Reached one? Tap it…

9
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:46.700
…Mark Completed
